          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ico ni co cagezwe c’ifūhe, ku mugore akiganzwa n’umugabo wiwe, akareka kuba ari we arāba, akīhumānya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "no ku mugabo afatwa n’ifūhe, agafūhira umugore wiwe. Uwo mugabo az’ ashire uwo mugore imbere yanje Uhoraho, umuherezi amukorere ibishinzwe n’ico cagezwe vyose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.18.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 18:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwo mugabo azoba atsinze ntazoba yaragabitanije, uwo mugore ni we azogībgako n’ukugabitanya kwiwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
